{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\ndef main():\n    n, h = map(int, input().split())\n    dp = [[-1] * (n + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        dp[0][i] = 0\n        dp[i][0] = 0\n\n    def calc(a, b):\n        if dp[a][b] != -1:\n            return dp[a][b]\n        total = 0\n        for m in range(1, a + 1):\n            total += calc(m - 1, b - 1) * sum(calc(a - m, i) for i in range(b))\n            total += calc(a - m, b - 1) * sum(calc(m - 1, i) for i in range(b - 1))\n        dp[a][b] = total\n        return total\n\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        for j in range(n + 1):\n            calc(i, j)\n\n    print(sum(dp[n][i] for i in range(h, n + 1)))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\nimport java.math.BigInteger;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BigInteger[][] dp;\n    static int n;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        n = sc.nextInt();\n        int h = sc.nextInt();\n        dp = new BigInteger[n + 1][n + 1];\n        // Initialize base cases\n        dp[0][0] = BigInteger.ONE;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            dp[0][i] = BigInteger.ZERO;\n            dp[i][0] = BigInteger.ZERO;\n        }\n        // Fill DP table\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= n; j++) {\n                calc(i, j);\n            }\n        }\n        // Compute result sum\n        BigInteger result = BigInteger.ZERO;\n        for (int i = h; i <= n; i++) {\n            result = result.add(dp[n][i]);\n        }\n        System.out.println(result);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n\n    static BigInteger calc(int a, int b) {\n        if (dp[a][b] != null) {\n            return dp[a][b];\n        }\n        BigInteger total = BigInteger.ZERO;\n        for (int m = 1; m <= a; m++) {\n            // First term: calc(m-1, b-1) * sum_{i=0}^{b-1} calc(a-m, i)\n            BigInteger term1 = calc(m - 1, b - 1);\n            BigInteger sum1 = BigInteger.ZERO;\n            for (int i = 0; i < b; i++) {\n                sum1 = sum1.add(calc(a - m, i));\n            }\n            total = total.add(term1.multiply(sum1));\n\n            // Second term: calc(a-m, b-1) * sum_{i=0}^{b-2} calc(m-1, i)\n            BigInteger term2 = calc(a - m, b - 1);\n            BigInteger sum2 = BigInteger.ZERO;\n            for (int i = 0; i < b - 1; i++) {\n                sum2 = sum2.add(calc(m - 1, i));\n            }\n            total = total.add(term2.multiply(sum2));\n        }\n        dp[a][b] = total;\n        return total;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-5.602820692729438e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.303362584323622e-05, -3.814689989667386e-06, 0.0, -0.575959324836731, -0.06432822346687317, -1.156323378381785e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -7.545663538621739e-